{
    "title": "Witt Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "Classic Solitaire is the best way to play the classic card games for the card game lovers, FREE, offline & online! If you love Classic Solitaire or Patience or Klondike, you must love this beautiful and smooth Classic Solitaire Card Game! It's time to relax, relieve stress, train your brain, challenge yourself and be a Klondike or Patience master. Try this original classic Klondike Solitaire cards game!\r\n\r\nWitt Solitaire - Card Games, also known as Patience in Europe (such as the United Kingdom, French, etc.), are Solitaire card games, and can be played by a single player. \r\n\r\nSolitaire card game used to be a classic computer game. At prensent, we make it easy for people who love card games to play classic Solitaire games on mobile phone and tablet. Playing Solitaire is a great time killer and keep your brain and mind sharp. Solitaire is classic card games. Classic Solitaire Card Games is well designed for phones and tablets. We have android and iOS versions, and you can also download solitaire without effort for ipad and iphone.\r\n\r\nSolitaire is an addictive, challenging classic card game for true lovers of all card games. Witt Solitaire - Card Game is a puzzle game, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri Peaks, Pyramind, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon. Like Spider Solitaire, Freecell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, this card game is definitely more fun! The Original Solitaire Game brings a new experience to the Classic Solitaire Card Game!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\nTo solve this Solitaire Klondike card puzzle, you should move all cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the foundations. There is one deck - 52 cards in the classic Solitaire Klondike game. \r\nYou need to stack cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move cards between columns, and stack cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. For example, a black 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of cards by dragging the whole stack to another column. Play classic Solitaire games and you can choose any scoring mode you like. \r\n\r\nMAIN FEATURE OF CLASSIC SOLITAIRE CARD GAMES\r\n- Freely adjust larger cards, suitable for card lovers of all ages\r\n- Classic solitaire gameplay, super fun and addictive\r\n- Left-hand mode, more convenient for you\r\n- Play classic solitaire draw 1 & draw 3 modes\r\n- Statistics section, keep improving and challenging yourself\r\n- Daily Challenge, start every day with a new solitaire card game\r\n- Unlimited hints and undo\r\n\r\nClassic solitaire is a popular game all around the world. For years people play Solitaire using Solitaire cards and now they can play Classic Solitaire app on their phone. They can play Classic Solitaire on the bus, in the line and any where they want. They don't have to shuffle the cards any more. It's time saving. Solitaire Klondike is the best way for you to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere with patience and insistence.\r\n\r\nPlay the #1 FREE SOLITAIRE card game now! See for yourself why so many people love this solitaire game! Classic solitaire refreshes your day. Have fun with this classic solitaire card game in no minutes! Solitaire card game is always classic and fun!You would absolutely love playing this Solitaire Klondike card game. \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://game.jianhuangames.com/games/Privacy-Policy.html",
