ack 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of cards by dragging the whole stack to another column. Play classic Solitaire games and you can choose any scoring mode you like. <br><br>MAIN FEATURE OF CLASSIC SOLITAIRE CARD GAMES<br>- Freely adjust larger cards, suitable for card lovers of all ages<br>- Classic solitaire gameplay, super fun and addictive<br>- Left-hand mode, more convenient for you<br>- Play classic solitaire draw 1 &amp; draw 3 modes<br>- Statistics section, keep improving and challenging yourself<br>- Daily Challenge, start every day with a new solitaire card game<br>- Unlimited hints and undo<br><br>Classic solitaire is a popular game all around the world. For years people play Solitaire using Solitaire cards and now they can play Classic Solitaire app on their phone. They can play Classic Solitaire on the bus, in the line and any where they want. They don&#39;t have to shuffle the cards any more. It&#39;s time saving. Solitaire Klondike is the best way for you to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere with patience and insistence.<br><br>Play the #1 FREE SOLITAIRE card game now! See for yourself why so many people love this solitaire game! Classic solitaire refreshes your day. Have fun with this classic solitaire card game in no minutes! Solitaire card game is always classic and fun!You would absolutely love playing this Solitaire Klondike card game. <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://game.jianhuangames.com/games/Privacy-Policy.html",
